| Field | Notes |
|---|---|
| `wallet.kind` | `managed`: Turf Monster holds the wallet and signs for the player, so the API can enter, unless a Phantom wallet is also linked to the account. `self_custodied` or `none`: it cannot. |
| `free_entry_tokens` | Unspent free entries. `null` means unreadable just now, not zero. |
| `account.frozen` | `true` when the account is on hold. Reads still work; writes are refused. |
| `api_key.expires_at` | Keys last <%= key_days %> days. After that the player creates a new one. |
| `api_key.eligibility.age_gate` | `passed`, or `not_required` when age verification was not required at creation. |

